Z||000017||LT1 Chop Top||09-20-2001||05:23 PM||||1Fst,<P>What do you mean toed??  IF you are referring to the raked look of the chop top, that is intentional.  Archie is a hot rodder, and he desingned it with a common trait of a hot rod.  I happen to think it looks good, but it seems many don't.  If I decide to go with bigger rear tires, I may redo the rear end with Ryanh/Held suspension, as the set up one of my clubmates has is awesome....but I will wait until the current tires need to be changed.<P>For interior pics check these links... <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/010399.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/010399.html</A> <BR>and <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/008383.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/008383.html</A> ||||reg||1
